  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEF 24 25 - Events at Beijing 30+ and Asia-Pacific Forum on Sustainable Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed to ensure the full effective and meaningful participation of WROs and CSOs with a focus on LGBT+, SRHR, Disability Rights and inclusion in these large regional moments &#x2013; with a focus in supporting those very rural and local organisations with little access to funding. The funding will be used to enable them to meaningfully participate in the Beijing+30 and AWID global conferences.</narrative>
  </description>
